.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
**/.build/
**/bin/
**/obj/
/.cursor/
/.specstory/
/.vscode/
/.cursorindexingignore
/.package-staging/
/runtime/
/Settings/
/logs/
/dist/
/artifacts/
/*.app/
/*.iso
/__ia_thumb.jpg
/simscomplete-*.jpg
/the-sims-1-complete-collection_202501_meta.*
/tools/ghidra/
/tools/ghidra.zip
/tools/display-info
/analysis/*
!/analysis/*.json
!/analysis/*.png
!/analysis/full-decompilation/
!/analysis/decompiled/
!/analysis/gimex-decompiled/
!/analysis/legacy-decompiled/
!/analysis/legacy-shaders/

# Original game files are never committed or shipped. They belong in /runtime/ (ignored above);
# these catch an install or ISO extracted anywhere else in the tree.
*.iso
**/GameData/
**/UIGraphics/
**/ExpansionShared/
**/TemplateUserData/
**/Expansion Pack*/
**/ExpansionPack*/
/Downloads/
**/SoundData/
**/Music/
**/UserData*/

# Scene exports extracted from the game (sprites, depth maps); never commit them.
*.rgba
*.depth8
--check-*/
# Compiled packs carry game-derived data; only the hand-written example is tracked.
/packs/*
!/packs/example/
